{
  "id": "1SA.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samueli 8",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli alipokuwa mzee, aliwafanya watoto wake wa kiume kuwa waamuzi wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtoto wake wa kwanza wa kiume aliitwa Yoeli, na wa pili aliitwa Abiya. Wote wawili walikuwa waamuzi huko Beer-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini watoto hao hawakufuata mwenendo wa baba yao. Bali walianza kujitafutia faida. Wakapokea rushwa na kupotosha haki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, viongozi wote wa Israeli walikusanyika pamoja, na kumwendea Samueli mjini Rama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakamwambia, “Tazama, wewe sasa ni mzee na watoto wako hawafuati mwenendo wako. Hivyo, tuteulie mfalme wa kututawala kama yalivyo mataifa mengine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini jambo la Waisraeli kutaka wapewe mfalme wa kuwatawala, halikumpendeza Samueli. Naye akamwomba Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia, “Sikiliza kila kitu ambacho watu wanakuambia; maana hawajakukataa wewe, bali wamenikataa mimi kuwa mfalme juu yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tangu nilipowatoa Misri, wameniacha mimi, wamekuwa wakiitumikia miungu mingine mpaka leo. Sasa hayo matendo ambayo wamekuwa wakinitendea mimi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "wakinitendea mimi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Haya hayapo katika makala ya Kiebrania.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ndiyo wanayokutendea na wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, wasikilize, lakini, waonye vikali, na waeleze waziwazi jinsi mfalme atakayewatawala atakavyowatendea.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, Samueli akawaambia wale watu waliokuwa wanaomba wapewe mfalme maneno yote ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli aliwaambia, “Hivi ndivyo mfalme wenu atakayewatawala atakavyowatendea: Watoto wenu wa kiume atawafanya wawe waendeshaji wa magari yake, na wengine kuwa wapandafarasi wake, na wengine watapiga mbio mbele ya magari yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atajichagulia wengine wawe makamanda wa vikosi vyake vya maelfu na wengine wawe makamanda wa vikosi vya watu hamsinihamsini. Atawafanya wengine wamlimie mashamba yake na kuvuna mazao yake. Atawafanya wengine pia wamtengenezee zana za vita, na wengine wamtengenezee vipuli vya magari yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binti zenu atawachukua kuwa watengenezaji marashi, wengine wapishi na wengine waokaji mikate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atayachukua mashamba yenu mazuri, mashamba ya mizeituni, na mashamba ya mizabibu na kuwapa watumishi wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atachukua sehemu ya kumi ya nafaka zenu na ya zabibu zenu na kuwapa maofisa wake na watumishi wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atachukua watumishi wenu wa kiume na wa kike na ng'ombe wenu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ng'ombe wenu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makala ya Kiebrania: Vijana wa kiume.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wazuri na punda wenu wazuri kabisa na kuwafanya wamfanyie kazi zake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atachukua sehemu ya kumi ya kondoo wenu. Na nyinyi wenyewe mtakuwa watumwa wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati huo, nyinyi mtalalamika kwa sababu ya mfalme wenu ambaye mmejichagulia nyinyi wenyewe. Lakini Mwenyezi-Mungu hatawajibu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo watu walikataa kumsikiliza Samueli, wakasema, “La! Sisi tutakuwa na mfalme juu yetu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ili nasi pia tuwe kama mataifa mengine. Mfalme wetu, atatuhukumu, atatuongoza na kutupigania vita vyetu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli alipokwisha sikiliza kila kitu walichosema, akaenda na kumweleza Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Samueli, “Wasikilize na wapatie mfalme.” Kisha Samueli akawaambia Waisraeli warudi nyumbani, kila mtu mjini kwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
